kmplify-node (0.6.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian package. The binary with the desktop window (kmplify-node
    gui), the desktop entry and icon, the systemd unit for a headless node
    (installed, not enabled), the environment template and the docs.
  * LAN router: mDNS discovery, PIN pairing with SPAKE2, mutual TLS between
    paired nodes, Ollama- and OpenAI-compatible routing proxies on 11440 and
    11441, node-info on 14418; one router per machine that every view attaches
    to (gui, tui --router, run --router).

 -- KMPLIFY <hallo@kmplify.de>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 09:41:41 +0200
